        "Note",
        "Note",
        "<strong>Six hundred sixty-six talents.</strong> The ironic number anticipates Revelation 13:18, where it marks the Beast. Tarshish is variously identified — Tartessos in southern Spain, Sardinia, or a generic term for distant Phoenician trade. Solomon’s wealth here is meant to evoke not just prosperity but the dangerous excess that 11:1-13 will indict.",
