        "Note",
        "Note",
        "<strong>Shishak’s invasion.</strong> Pharaoh Shoshenq I (c. 945-924 BCE), founder of the Twenty-second Dynasty. The Karnak relief in his Bubastite Portal lists 154 conquered Palestinian cities, including many in Israel and Judah. This is one of the strongest synchronisms between biblical narrative and external Iron Age archaeology, securely placing Rehoboam’s reign in absolute chronology.",
